# qualification.kvx - Paxeer X CI on Fly.io executed-evidence ledger.
#
# Append-only. [observation.<task>.<n>] records an assumption, an unrelated or
# pre-existing failure, a cross-task contradiction, a missing external
# interface, or a repair that would require weakening a check: keys task, file,
# symbol, observed, assumption, severity (blocker | suspect | assumption | note),
# at most six lines, never re-run. [gate.<task>.<n>] records one executed gate:
# revision, command, exit_code, log_path.
